if __name__ == '__main__':
    app.run(host='0.0.0.0', port=8080)
```

### Summary

By following these steps, you can set up Nginx to terminate SSL and forward plain HTTP traffic to your backend services. This ensures that all communication between clients and your server is encrypted, while your backend services can operate over plain HTTP.

